{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;In this darkness, your loyalty is no longer to the Emperor\u2019s command \u2014 but to your own faith.&quot;</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two paths to victory</strong> \u2013 master stealth or engage in direct combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear sandbox missions</strong> \u2013 multiple routes, multiple assassination methods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ assassination animations</strong> \u2013 combo chains and environmental kills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic plague system</strong> \u2013 enemies evolve with the changing world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 choices and sacrifices shape your destiny</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2a <strong>Stealth Without Limits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/3b149b775682e4db53cabd414678813a.poster.avif?t=1755709956\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/3b149b775682e4db53cabd414678813a.webm?t=1755709956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/3b149b775682e4db53cabd414678813a.mp4?t=1755709956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate any way you choose. Slip past patrols, exploit terrain, set traps \u2014 or kick down the front door and fight your way through.<br>There\u2019s no \u201cright\u201d way to complete a mission. Every assassination is a battle of strategy, patience, and timing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Assassination &amp; Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/6a9cf3182f0e7d1d0136e6d7d8455595.poster.avif?t=1755709956\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/6a9cf3182f0e7d1d0136e6d7d8455595.webm?t=1755709956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/6a9cf3182f0e7d1d0136e6d7d8455595.mp4?t=1755709956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From silent kills with a dagger to long-range bow shots, from poisoned blades to deadly throwing knives \u2014 chain your attacks with environmental hazards to craft your perfect kill route.<br>Adapt, improvise, and strike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>A World Changed by Plague</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/f65b73af18e5024750aa96d7108c80d4.poster.avif?t=1755709956\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/f65b73af18e5024750aa96d7108c80d4.webm?t=1755709956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/f65b73af18e5024750aa96d7108c80d4.mp4?t=1755709956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The plague twists both body and mind. Infected enemies fight with unpredictable aggression, while human factions clash for control of the collapsing world.<br>Every step forward changes the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc67 <strong>Her Fate\u2026 Is Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/0a194f877ae69e07ac93d8eb62280057.poster.avif?t=1755709956\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/0a194f877ae69e07ac93d8eb62280057.webm?t=1755709956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/0a194f877ae69e07ac93d8eb62280057.mp4?t=1755709956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl you protect is immune to the plague \u2014 and holds the key to saving humanity.<br>Your journey is not only to safeguard her life, but to decide what salvation truly means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Add to your Wishlist and support stealth games!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644850?t=1755709956","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644850?t=1755709956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/6cd5f1cb0dc9ff53fc3a00721f551983fe2bace4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755709956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/6cd5f1cb0dc9ff53fc3a00721f551983fe2bace4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755709956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Assassinating corrupt enemies triggers bloody kill effects."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;In this darkness, your loyalty is no longer to the Emperor\u2019s command \u2014 but to your own faith.&quot;</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Core 